cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to Murmur in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Murmur"
abstract: >-
  Murmur is a local-first macOS app that records meetings, transcribes them on-device
  with Whisper, writes structured notes as plain Markdown, and answers questions across
  everything recorded. AI can run on the Mac or, after explicit consent, through
  redacted cloud providers.
authors:
